      519.34,
      538.37,
      572.35
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Fairly heavy falls about 75 mm are likely at some places in Galle, Matara, Kaluthara and Rathnapura districts.",
